  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Initial Types**\n\nI\'m working on the initial TypeScript models. Right now, I\'m setting up a shared types file, `src/types.ts`. I\'ve already defined the `Season` and `DepartmentCategory` types, including the `\'ortofrutta\'` category. Next, I need to flesh out more of the data models based on these fundamental types.\n\n\n**Expanding Core Types**\n\nI\'ve expanded the `DepartmentCategory` type to include `\'macelleria_pescheria\'`, `\'latticini_freschi\'`, `\'dispensa_secco\'`, `\'surgelati\'`, and `\'cura_casa_altro\'`. Furthermore, I\'ve defined `Assignee`, `MealSlotType`, and `MealType` enums, which will dictate how meals are assigned and structured. Now, I\'m constructing the `Dish`, `MealSlot`, `DayMeals`, `WeekMenu`, and `ShoppingItem` interfaces. I will ensure these interfaces are comprehensive and flexible.\n\n\n**Defining More Types**\n\nI\'m now defining the `Recipe`, `UserProfile`, and `Household` types. I\'m focusing on attributes like `createdAt`, `prepTime`, and the structure of `ingredients` within `Recipe`. I\'m also including `lastPreparedDate` as an optional attribute. The `UserProfile` includes role and theme settings. Finally, I\'m fleshing out `Household` with properties for managing menus, the shopping list, and recipes, including an `updatedAt` field.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_2598708"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false,\"CodeContent\":\"export type Season = \'spring\' | \'summer\' | \'autumn\' | \'winter\' | \'all_year\';\\n\\nexport type DepartmentCategory =\\n  | \'ortofrutta\'\\n  | \'macelleria_pescheria\'\\n  | \'latticini_freschi\'\\n  | \'dispensa_secco\'\\n  | \'surgelati\'\\n  | \'cura_casa_altro\';\\n\\nexport type Assignee = \'together\' | \'daniele\' | \'partner\';\\n\\nexport type MealSlotType = \'together\' | \'separate\';\\n\\nexport type MealType = \'pranzo\' | \'cena\';\\n\\nexport type DayKey = \'lun\' | \'mar\' | \'mer\' | \'gio\' | \'ven\' | \'sab\' | \'dom\';\\n\\nexport interface Dish {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  recipeId?: string;\\n  ingredients?: string[];\\n  notes?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface MealSlot {\\n  type: MealSlotType;\\n  togetherDishes: Dish[];\\n  danieleDishes: Dish[];\\n  partnerDishes: Dish[];\\n  notes?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface DayMeals {\\n  dayKey: DayKey;\\n  dayLabel: string;\\n  pranzo: MealSlot;\\n  cena: MealSlot;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface WeekMenu {\\n  weekId: string; // e.g. \'2026-W42\'\\n  days: Record<DayKey, DayMeals>;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ShoppingItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  category: DepartmentCategory;\\n  assignee: Assignee;\\n  dishName?: string;\\n  dayKey?: DayKey;\\n  isDone: boolean;\\n  checkedBy?: string;\\n  checkedAt?: string;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Recipe {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  season: Season;\\n  category: \'Primo\' | \'Secondo\' | \'Piatto Unico\' | \'Contorno\' | \'Lievitato\';\\n  prepTime: string;\\n  ingredients: string[];\\n  notes?: string;\\n  lastPreparedDate?: string; // YYYY-MM-DD\\n}\\n\\nexport type ColorTheme = \'salvia\' | \'terracotta\' | \'mirtillo\' | \'avocado\' | \'slate\';\\nexport type DisplayMode = \'light\' | \'dark\' | \'auto\';\\n\\nexport interface UserPreferences {\\n  currentRole: \'daniele\' | \'partner\';\\n  colorTheme: ColorTheme;\\n  mode: DisplayMode;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface HouseholdUsers {\\n  daniele: { name: string; avatar: string };\\n  partner: { name: string; avatar: string };\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Household {\\n  code: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  users: HouseholdUsers;\\n  activeWeekId: string;\\n  menus: Record<string, WeekMenu>;\\n  shoppingList: ShoppingItem[];\\n  recipes: Recipe[];\\n  updatedAt: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface SeasonalAISuggestion {\\n  name: string;\\n  description: string;\\n  season: Season;\\n  prepTime: string;\\n  category: \'Primo\' | \'Secondo\' | \'Piatto Unico\' | \'Contorno\' | \'Lievitato\';\\n  ingredients: string[];\\n  whySeasonal: string;\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Shared TypeScript types for Household, Week Menu, Shopping List, and Recipes\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/types.ts\",\"toolAction\":\"Writing shared types\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create src/types.ts\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "write_to_file"
    }
    thinking_duration {
