  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Envisioning Multi-User Access**\n\nI\'m now focusing on enabling broader access. I envision a system where users log in via Google, create their own \"homes,\" and then invite others to share them through a link. My current focus is how to design this multi-user structure effectively.\n\n\n**Assessing Firebase Integration**\n\nI\'m now comparing the `set_up_firebase` tool with the broader `firebase-integration-rpc` skill. My thought is, I need to understand `set_up_firebase`\'s blueprint representation first. This will inform how to best leverage `firebase-integration-rpc` for multi-user functionality, especially user authentication and access control.\n\n\n**Validating Firebase Protocols**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the critical Firebase setup steps to ensure user trust and application integrity. I need to make sure the tool is always called initially with `userConfirmedTermsAcceptedInUI: false`, immediately stopping the conversation to present the Firebase UI for user confirmation. I\'m focusing on rigorously validating that the acceptance or decline message is received before proceeding with `userConfirmedTermsAcceptedInUI: true`, and the crucial security rules generation and ESLint validation workflows. The skill file path will need to be checked.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
