    session_summary: "{\"step_index\":217,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:43:29Z\",\"input_tokens\":14747,\"cache_read_tokens\":18463,\"output_tokens\":421,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing User Intent**\\n\\nI\'ve just compacted the conversation history to grasp the current state. My focus is now on the user\'s latest request and how it relates to the initial specifications for \\\"Menu & Spesa Condivisa\\\". I\'m meticulously examining the requests in chronological order to discern the user\'s evolving needs and intentions. The requests \\\"1. Initial spec for \'Menu & Spesa Condivisa\'\\\" and \\\"2. Dove\\\" are under review.\\n\\n\\n**Refining Feature Scope**\\n\\nI\'m now diving into the latest request concerning \\\"insieme/separati\\\" functionality. I\'m focusing on the logic tied to the number of people associated with a house. Specifically, I\'m analyzing the need for conditional options based on the group size, and understanding how to apply different \'insieme/separati\' options for houses with one, two, or more than two people. This involves determining the optimal way to manage user choices.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"list_dir\",\"args\":{\"DirectoryPath\":\"\\\"/src\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Listing src directory\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"List src directory\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":219,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:43:33Z\",\"input_tokens\":2614,\"cache_read_tokens\":31342,\"output_tokens\":69,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/types.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing types.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View types.ts\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":221,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:43:40Z\",\"input_tokens\":3788,\"cache_read_tokens\":31891,\"output_tokens\":135,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/WeeklyMenu/WeeklyMenuView.tsx\\\"\",\"ContentOffset\":\"0\",\"EndLine\":\"180\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing WeeklyMenuView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View WeeklyMenuView.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":223,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:43:45Z\",\"input_tokens\":2571,\"cache_read_tokens\":35666,\"output_tokens\":111,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/WeeklyMenu/WeeklyMenuView.tsx\\\"\",\"ContentOffset\":\"0\",\"EndLine\":\"350\",\"StartLine\":\"181\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing WeeklyMenuView.tsx lines 181-350\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View WeeklyMenuView.tsx lines 181-350\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":225,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:43:49Z\",\"input_tokens\":2734,\"cache_read_tokens\":38225,\"output_tokens\":107,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/WeeklyMenu/WeeklyMenuView.tsx\\\"\",\"ContentOffset\":\"0\",\"EndLine\":\"627\",\"StartLine\":\"351\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing WeeklyMenuView.tsx lines 351-627\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View WeeklyMenuView.tsx lines 351-627\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":227,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:43:54Z\",\"input_tokens\":4520,\"cache_read_tokens\":40948,\"output_tokens\":84,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"list_dir\",\"args\":{\"DirectoryPath\":\"\\\"/src/components/WeeklyMenu\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Listing WeeklyMenu directory\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"List WeeklyMenu directory\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":229,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:43:56Z\",\"input_tokens\":2267,\"cache_read_tokens\":43408,\"output_tokens\":80,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/WeeklyMenu/MealGroupingModal.tsx\\\"\",\"ContentOffset\":\"0\",\"EndLine\":\"180\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing MealGroupingModal.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View MealGroupingModal.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":231,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:44:00Z\",\"input_tokens\":2684,\"cache_read_tokens\":45665,\"output_tokens\":111,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/WeeklyMenu/MealGroupingModal.tsx\\\"\",\"ContentOffset\":\"0\",\"EndLine\":\"311\",\"StartLine\":\"181\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing MealGroupingModal.tsx lines 181-311\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View MealGroupingModal.tsx lines 181-311\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":233,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:44:04Z\",\"input_tokens\":2271,\"cache_read_tokens\":48339,\"output_tokens\":275,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing the Prompt\'s Logic**\\n\\nI\'m now zeroing in on the nuances of the prompt\'s logic. I\'m focusing on how the \\\"together/separate\\\" concept hinges on the number of individuals linked to a dwelling. The critical distinction lies in the thresholds: one person means no \\\"together/separate,\\\" two or more trigger it. This needs careful consideration.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/Settings/SettingsView.tsx\\\"\",\"ContentOffset\":\"0\",\"EndLine\":\"200\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing SettingsView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View SettingsView.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":235,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:44:09Z\",\"input_tokens\":3164,\"cache_read_tokens\":50676,\"output_tokens\":118,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/Sett