\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:51:11Z\",\"input_tokens\":3818,\"cache_read_tokens\":155421,\"output_tokens\":58,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"lint_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Running lint_applet\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Lint code\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":323,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:51:15Z\",\"input_tokens\":2412,\"cache_read_tokens\":157113,\"output_tokens\":110,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/ShoppingList/ShoppingListView.tsx\\\"\",\"ContentOffset\":\"0\",\"EndLine\":\"340\",\"StartLine\":\"290\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing ShoppingListView.tsx lines 290-340\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View ShoppingListView.tsx lines 290-340\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":325,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:51:19Z\",\"input_tokens\":3180,\"cache_read_tokens\":157379,\"output_tokens\":103,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/ShoppingList/ShoppingListView.tsx\\\"\",\"ContentOffset\":\"0\",\"EndLine\":\"260\",\"StartLine\":\"220\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing ShoppingListView lines 220-260\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View ShoppingListView lines 220-260\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":327,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:51:23Z\",\"input_tokens\":3035,\"cache_read_tokens\":158417,\"output_tokens\":157,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/ShoppingList/ShoppingListView.tsx\\\"\",\"ContentOffset\":\"0\",\"EndLine\":\"265\",\"StartLine\":\"190\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing ShoppingListView lines 190-265\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View ShoppingListView lines 190-265\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":329,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:51:31Z\",\"input_tokens\":3642,\"cache_read_tokens\":159295,\"output_tokens\":1903,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing UI Controls**\\n\\nI\'ve been examining the component that handles filtering and grouping. I\'ve specifically zoned in on lines 208-262, particularly the conditional rendering of the assignee filter based on the number of members. I am noting the use of React fragments and how they structure the UI into rows and sections. The goal is to fully understand how these controls impact the broader data set.\\n\\n\\n**Refining HTML Structure**\\n\\nI have identified a structural error in the HTML rendering. The initial implementation incorrectly nested the \\\"Clean completed\\\" button within the assignee filter\'s `<div>`, causing the closing `</div>` to be misplaced. I have refactored the HTML structure so that row 1\'s div contains just the filter components, and the \\\"Clean Completed\\\" button is now correctly placed. This ensures the intended layout, and proper conditional rendering, is achieved.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Fix div nesting for assignee filters and clean completed button\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"262\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Wrap filters and clean completed button in the same flex container\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"      {/* Filter & Grouping Controls */}\\\\n      <div className=\\\\\\\"bg-app-card rounded-2xl border border-app-subtle p-3 sm:p-4 shadow-xs space-y-3\\\\\\\">\\\\n        {/* Row 1: Assignee Filters & Clean button */}\\\\n        <div className=\\\\\\\"flex flex-wrap items-cent\\n<truncated 2496 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"208\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"      {/* Filter & Grouping Controls */}\\\\n      <div className=\\\\\\\"bg-app-card rounded-2xl border border-app-subtle p-3 sm:p-4 shadow-xs space-y-3\\\\\\\">\\\\n        {/* Row 1: Assignee Filters (only if more than 1 person) */}\\\\n        {members.length > 1 && (\\\\n  \\n<truncated 2225 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/ShoppingList/ShoppingListView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Fixing filter row in ShoppingListView\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Fix filter row in ShoppingListView.tsx\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":331,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:51:48Z\",\"input_tokens\":2831,\"cache_read_tokens\":163033,\"output_tokens\":43,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"lint_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Running lint_applet\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Lint code\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":333,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:51:51Z\",\"input_tokens\":2568,\"cache_read_tokens\":163734,\"output_tokens\":312,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing TypeScript Issues**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on pinpointing a TypeScript issue within the `server.ts` file, specifically lines 146-147. It appears that the `newHh.users` property, being optional in the `Household` type, presents a potential null/undefined access scenario. I\'m investigating how this could impact the code. I\'m taking the opportunity to understand how this is used, in the specific context of where `danieleName` is used.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/server.ts\\\"\",\"ContentOffset\":\"0\",\"EndLine\":\"155\",\"StartLine\":\"142\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing server.ts lines 142-155\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View server.ts lines 142-155\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":335,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:51:59Z\",\"input_tokens\":2851,\"cache_read_tokens\":164271,\"output_tokens\":279,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Fix safe access to users in server.ts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"149\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Safely check newHh.users before assigning\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"    if (name) newHh.name = name;\\\\n    if (danieleName && newHh.users) newHh.users.daniele.name = danieleName;\\\\n    if (partnerName && newHh.users) newHh.users.partner.name = partnerName;\\\\n    newHh.updatedAt = new Date().toISOString();\\\"\",\"StartLine\":\"145\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"    if (name) newHh.name = name;\\\\n    if (danieleName) newHh.users.daniele.name = danieleName;\\\\n    if (partnerName) newHh.users.partner.name = partnerName;\\\\n    newHh.updatedAt = new Date().toISOString();\\\"\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/server.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating server.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update server.ts safe access\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":337,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:52:04Z\",\"input_tokens\":2774,\"cache_read_tokens\":164986,\"output_tokens\":107,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/Recipes/AISuggestModal.tsx\\\"\",\"ContentOffset\":\"0\",\"EndLine\":\"270\",\"StartLine\":\"245\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing AISuggestModal.tsx lines 245-270\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View AISuggestModal.tsx lines 245-270\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":339,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:52:09Z\",\"input_tokens\":2832,\"cache_read_tokens\":165623,\"output_tokens\":137,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/Recipes/AISuggestModal.tsx\\\"\",\"ContentOffset\":\"0\",\"EndLine\":\"50\",\"StartLine\":\"20\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing AISuggestModal.tsx imports and context\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View AISuggestModal.tsx lines 20-50\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":341,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:52:13Z\",\"input_tokens\":2872,\"cac