75 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/Recipes/RecipesView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating dynamic assignee in RecipesView\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update RecipesView.tsx schedule assignee\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":353,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:53:06Z\",\"input_tokens\":3277,\"cache_read_tokens\":170976,\"output_tokens\":129,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/Settings/SettingsView.tsx\\\"\",\"ContentOffset\":\"0\",\"EndLine\":\"160\",\"StartLine\":\"140\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing SettingsView.tsx lines 140-160\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View SettingsView.tsx lines 140-160\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":355,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:53:15Z\",\"input_tokens\":2767,\"cache_read_tokens\":172120,\"output_tokens\":323,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Safely update users in SettingsView.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"151\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Provide safe defaults for prev.users\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"    await updateHousehold((prev) => ({\\\\n      ...prev,\\\\n      users: {\\\\n        daniele: { avatar: \'\360\237\221\250\342\200\215\360\237\215\263\', ...(prev.users?.daniele || {}), name: danieleName.trim() || \'Daniele\' },\\\\n        partner: { avatar: \'\360\237\221\251\342\200\215\360\237\214\276\', ...(prev.users?.partner |\\n<truncated 68 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"144\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"    await updateHousehold((prev) => ({\\\\n      ...prev,\\\\n      users: {\\\\n        daniele: { ...prev.users.daniele, name: danieleName.trim() || \'Daniele\' },\\\\n        partner: { ...prev.users.partner, name: partnerName.trim() || \'Partner\' },\\\\n      },\\\\n    }\\n<truncated 4 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/Settings/SettingsView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Fixing safe access in SettingsView\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Fix users safe access in SettingsView.tsx\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":357,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:53:23Z\",\"input_tokens\":2826,\"cache_read_tokens\":172753,\"output_tokens\":43,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"lint_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Running lint_applet\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Lint code\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":359,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:53:27Z\",\"input_tokens\":2263,\"cache_read_tokens\":173460,\"output_tokens\":60,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"compile_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Testing applet compilation\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Run compile_applet\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":361,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:53:31Z\",\"input_tokens\":2261,\"cache_read_tokens\":173604,\"output_tokens\":60,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"restart_dev_server\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Restarting development server\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Restart dev server\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":363,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:53:34Z\",\"input_tokens\":2258,\"cache_read_tokens\":173746,\"output_tokens\":97,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"curl -s http://localhost:3000/api/households/CASA01 | head -c 200\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"5000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Testing household endpoint\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Verify household API\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":365,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:53:39Z\",\"input_tokens\":2375,\"cache_read_tokens\":173883,\"output_tokens\":1522,\"content\":\"La gestione dei pasti \303\250 ora **completamente dinamica in base al numero di persone associate a quella specifica casa**:\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 1. \360\237\221\244 Casa con 1 Sola Persona Associata\\n- **Nessuna opzione \\\"Insieme o Separati\\\"**: il pulsante scompare del tutto perch\303\251 non avrebbe senso.\\n- Il menu mostra direttamente e chiaramente i piatti personali da cucinare per quel pasto (Pranzo o Cena), senza distrazioni.\\n- Nella Lista della Spesa scompare la distinzione di assegnazione (tutti i prodotti sono direttamente per quell\'\\n<truncated 1407 bytes>\\npulsanti rapidi per provare subito il comportamento:\\n   - **`[ \360\237\221\244 1 Persona ]`** \342\236\224 torna al Menu per verificare la scomparsa totale di \\\"insieme/separati\\\".\\n   - **`[ \360\237\221\253 2 Persone ]`** \342\236\224 torna al Menu per vedere il toggle Insieme / Separati.\\n   - **`[ \360\237\221\250\342\200\215\360\237\221\251\342\200\215\360\237\221\247 3 Persone ]`** \342\236\224 prova l\'opzione \\\"1 solo e 2 insieme\\\".\\n   - **`[ \360\237\221\250\342\200\215\360\237\221\251\342\200\215\360\237\221\247\342\200\215\360\237\221\246 4 Persone ]`** \342\236\224 prova gli insiemi \\\"a due a due\\\" o \\\"3+1\\\".\\n3. Puoi anche aggiungere o rimuovere persone a piacere, cambiandone nome ed emoji.\",\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing User Questions**\\n\\nI\'ve confirmed the household API is working, returning code 0. Now I\'m carefully reviewing the user\'s questions. I\'m focusing on \\\"non capisco a cosa serve il poter switchare come utente (partner o Daniele)\\\" and \\\"OK c\'\303\250 anche la possibilit\303\240 di mettere pi\303\271 case?\\\". I\'m trying to determine their needs based on the Italian.\\n\\n\\n**Defining Meal Associations**\\n\\nNow I\'m designing the logic for meal associations based on the number of household members. For a single person, the \\\"togeth\\n<truncated 635 bytes>\\nld be \\\"in pairs,\\\" \\\"3 together & 1 alone,\\\" and so on. Users can create custom groupings by dragging or clicking members. The planned menu items will directly reflect these groups.\\n\\nI am also developing preset templates for managing people and multiple households. In Settings, the \\\"Associated People\\\" section provides instant templates for 1, 2, 3, or 4 people. Users can add and customize any number of people, including names and avatars. I am keeping in mind the need for a switch to manage multiple houses.\\n\\n\\n\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\",\"thinking\"]}\n{\"step_index\":332,\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:57:07Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\nOK voglio adesso metterlo a disposizione di pi\303\271 utenti, che fanno il login con google si creano le loro case e inseriscono chi vogliono condividendo il link. Come faccio?\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-20T10:57:07-07:00.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-3.8-flash\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-w2op2gd7ig5avrhrpf6qqs-726438682148.europe-west2.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-w2op2gd7ig5avrhrpf6qqs-726438682148.europe-west2.run.app\\nUser Email: daniele.marra@buonarroti.tn.it\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\"}\n{\"step_index\":333,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:57:07Z\",\"input_tokens\":102032,\"cache_read_tokens\":19266,\"output_tokens\":661,\"thinking\":\"**Envisioning Multi-User Access**\\n\\nI\'m now focusing on enabling broader access. I envision a system where users log in via Google, create their own \\\"homes,\\\" and then invite others to share them through a link. My current focus is how to design this multi-user structure effectively.\\n\\n\\n**Assessing Firebase Integration**\\n\\nI\'m now comparing the `set_up_firebase` tool with the broader `firebase-integration-rpc` skill. My thought is, I need to understand `set_up_firebase`\'s blueprint representation first. This wi\\n<truncated 231 bytes>\\nto ensure user trust and application integrity. I need to make sure the tool is always called initially with `userConfirmedTermsAcceptedInUI: false`, immediately stopping the conversation to present the Firebase UI for user confirmation. I\'m focusing on rigorously validating that the acceptance or decline message is received before proceeding with `userConfirmedTermsAcceptedInUI: true`, and the crucial security rules generation and ESLint validation workflows. The skill file path will need to be checked.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/skills/system_skills/firebase-integration-rpc/SKILL.md\\\"\",\"ContentOffset\":\"0\",\"EndLine\":\"100\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing Firebase integration skill\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View firebase-integration-rpc SKILL.md\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\"]}"
    included_step_index_start: 182
