  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Application Collections**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining the key data collections within the application. Right now, I\'m fleshing out the structure for `/users/{userId}`, which will store user profiles and household codes. I\'m also thinking about access control: reading will be determined by the `isOwner(userId)` function. Creating is allowed if you\'re the owner and incoming data matches your user ID.\n\n\n**Refining Household Access**\n\nI\'m now refining access controls for the `/households/{householdCode}` collection. Specifically, I\'m considering scenarios like joining via a direct link (`?code=ABC123`). The access rules for `get` and `list` are being meticulously crafted to ensure security, particularly with regard to `isSignedIn()` and ownership/membership criteria. I\'m prioritizing adherence to secure list query principles, particularly Pillar 8, to prevent unauthorized data exposure.\n\n\n**Evaluating Direct Client Connections**\n\nI\'m now evaluating direct client connections to Firebase Firestore, considering its impact on the Express server proxy. Real-time updates with `onSnapshot`, offline persistence with `enableIndexedDbPersistence`, and seamless Google Auth are looking great. The server can still handle AI tasks, like suggestions or ingredient generation, keeping API keys secure.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_135114"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false, \"CodeContent\":\"{\\n  \\\"entities\\\": {\\n    \\\"User\\\": {\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"User\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"User profile with their joined or created households\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n      \\\"properties\\\": {\\n        \\\"uid\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Unique Firebase User ID\\\" },\\n        \\\"email\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"User email address\\\" },\\n        \\\"displayName\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Display name\\\" },\\n        \\\"photoURL\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Avatar photo URL\\\" },\\n        \\\"households\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"array\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"List of household codes the user belongs to\\\" },\\n        \\\"createdAt\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"ISO timestamp\\\" },\\n        \\\"updatedAt\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"ISO timestamp\\\" }\\n      },\\n      \\\"required\\\": [\\\"uid\\\", \\\"displayName\\\"]\\n    },\\n    \\\"Household\\\": {\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Household\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Collaborative shared household with menu, shopping, members, and recipes\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n      \\\"properties\\\": {\\n        \\\"code\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Unique 6-10 character code\\\" },\\n        \\\"name\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Household display name\\\" },\\n        \\\"ownerUid\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"UID of the creator\\\" },\\n        \\\"ownerEmail\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Email of the creator\\\" },\\n        \\\"memberUids\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"array\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"UIDs of authorized members\\\" },\\n        \\\"members\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"array\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Configured meal persons (Daniele, Partner, etc.)\\\" },\\n        \\\"houses\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"array\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Physical locations (Casa Daniele, Casa Partner)\\\" },\\n        \\\"weeklyPlans\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Weekly meal plans keyed by weekId\\\" },\\n        \\\"shoppingList\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"array\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Collaborative shopping items\\\" },\\n        \\\"recipes\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"array\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Saved recipe collection\\\" },\\n        \\\"createdAt\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"ISO timestamp\\\" },\\n        \\\"updatedAt\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"ISO timestamp\\\" }\\n      },\\n      \\\"required\\\": [\\\"code\\\", \\\"name\\\", \\\"ownerUid\\\"]\\n    }\\n  },\\n  \\\"firestore\\\": {\\n    \\\"/users/{userId}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": \\\"User\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Personal user profiles and their saved households\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"/households/{householdCode}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": \\\"Household\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Shared households containing menu, shopping list, recipes and members\\\"\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create firebase-blueprint.json defining User and Household schemas\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/firebase-blueprint.json\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating firebase-blueprint.json\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create firebase-blueprint.json\"}"
