.value)}\n                  className=\"w-full px-3 py-2 text-xs rounded-xl border border-app-subtle bg-app-card text-app-main outline-hidden\"\n                />\n              </div>\n\n              <div className=\"flex justify-end gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-app-subtle\">"
